{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/18/5653950/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"nice to meet you！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はお茶会＆サイン会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆきなとせっちゃんが最後でした(T . T)(T . T)(T . T)(T . T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しい...けど(T . T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからあんまり会えなくなるって実感が無いくらい、お互い笑顔でいられて良かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/18/5653950/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆきな大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもわたしは頑張ろうと思いました(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神経衰弱楽しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにやってみたら全然できひんかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記憶するのが苦手ですな(｡>﹏<｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取れたのは一組だけ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"座ってお話しながら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を持ってきて下さるのかな〜？って楽しみでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしななやったら、Tシャツかマグカップがいいかなって思いました(V)o¥o(V)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終オーディションの場所、乃木坂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来るたびにオーディションのことを思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はいつ行くかなぁ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/18/5653950/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーまる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンザの予防接種を受けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"注射、大っ嫌い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大一ッ嫌い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、嫌なことって意外と終わってみたら一瞬だったって感じやから、いけるかな？という、どこからか湧いてきた謎の自信で自分を落ち着かせました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖かったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るくいこう！さすれば痛くないであろう(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いきますよ〜腕の力抜いて〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あっ痛い......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あいたたた〜」って声を出してしまったけど、ゆっくり薬入れてるから注射が長くって、そしたら痛みに慣れちゃって、最後にはなんと全然平気だったんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悟りました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あれ？よく考えたらこれつねられてるくらいの痛さやん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ成長！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野、少し強くなってたんですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかった〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでも注射はこの予防接種、1年に1回だけでいいです！！(T . T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/18/5653950/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"棚に入る！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎私の会社に、どいやさんが面接に来ました。採用して大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼は優秀な成績を残すはずです。是非よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎なあちゃんなら落ち葉をかき集めて何を作りたい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼き芋(^O^)／作ろーよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎冬でも首元はスッキリしている方が好きですか？それともマフラーとかしている方が好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首は隠してぬくぬくしたい(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポケモン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニャオニクス♀が可愛すぎてやばいです、あの不機嫌そうな目がたまらん！懐かれたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"}